Third-party assets — NOT covered by the MIT license above
---------------------------------------------------------

The following files are artwork, audio and imagery from DeepSeek Harness and
remain the property of their original owners. They are included here so that a
clone of this repository can be built and run as-is; the MIT grant above
applies only to the source code, build script and documentation written for
this project.

  assets/intro_dsh.mp4    the opening animation
  assets/link-start.wav   the "Link Start" voice clip
  assets/title.png        the title artwork
  assets/dsh.ico          the application icon
  docs/poster.jpg         promotional image

